[5249]="700698B1\n1\tHabla con Ransroth\tHabla con Ransroth.\n",
[5250]="7002E76D\n1\tHabla con Gredlan Artemisa\tHabla con Gredlan Artemisa.\n",
[5251]="700454F1\n1\tHabla con Rock\tAl completar esta misión, puedes seleccionar cualquier tipo de tokens de festival disponibles.\n",
[5252]="70003249\n1\tLleva los anillos de defensa a Gailthin\tGailthin se encuentra en la ciudad enana de Gondamon, en las tierras bajas de Ered Luin. Golhador te ha pedido que muestres los anillos de defensa al emisario Gailthin.\n",
[5253]="70037077\n1\tDefeat brigands at their camp near Oserley\tBrigands can be found at their camp, west of Oserley in the Broadacres of Rohan. You should defeat the brigands who have been thieving from the people of Oserley.\n2\tDefeat brigands at their camp near Oserley (total: 8)\tBrigands can be found at their camp, west of Oserley in the Broadacres of Rohan. You should defeat the brigands who have been thieving from the people of Oserley.\n",
[5254]="700442F2\n1\tPut out fires in the fields (total: 4)\tFires can be found in the fields near Parth Lisc. You should put out fires in the fields.\n2\tRecover supplies from Parth Lisc (total: 8)\tSupplies can be found around the farm houses in Parth Lisc. Now that the fires are dealt with, you should recover any supplies from the farm.\n3\tBring the supplies for Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[5255]="7006B609\n1\tDefeat crocodiles (total: 4)\030Defeat zizani (total: 6)\tSûlmur has offered you a reward for defeating crocodiles and zizani, what the locals call Neekers, in the papyrus fields at Mehêtur in Ambarûl.\n2\tTalk to Sûlmur\tYou have defeated crocodiles and zizani in the papyrus fields. You should return to Sûlmur north-east of the fields.\n",
[5256]="7002F994\n1\tPuedes encontrar granjeros alrededor del Salón del Hidromiel de Redilaldea, en sus respectivas granjas. Osin te ha pedido que busques a los distintos granjeros de Redilaldea y les prestes toda la ayuda que puedas.\t\n2\tRegresa con Osin a Redilaldea\tOsin se prepara fuera del Salón del Hidromiel, en el centro de Redilaldea. Los problemas de los granjeros se han resuelto y Osin ya puede concentrarse en sus propios problemas.\n",
[5257]="70009E7B\n1\tDerrota a Snowreap Sapper (total: 5)\030Derrota a Snowreap Guard (total: 5)\tThere are Snowreap-guards and sappers at Grothum, north of Ost Ringdyr. Lieutenant Ingi wishes to cull the Snowreap goblins from the Ettenmoors and weaken the forces which Angmar can bring to bear against the Free Peoples.\n2\tHabla con Lieutenant Ingi\tIngi is at Ost Ringdyr, south of Grothum. With the goblins dispatched, the time has come to return to Ingi.\n",
[5258]="70028CAE\n1\tDerrota a los jinetes de huargos (total: 2)\030Derrota a los líderes de la manada (total: 5)\tLos líderes de la manada huarga y los jinetes goblins de huargos pueden encontrarse cerca de las guaridas de huargos, al este del campamento de Garrun. Garrun te ha pedido que derrotes a los líderes de la manada y a los jinetes de huargos que merodean por las guaridas.\n2\tHabla con Garrun en el Valle del Isen\tGarrun está en su campamento, al oeste de las guaridas de huargos. Debes regresar junto a Garrun y llevarle noticias de tu éxito.\n",
[5259]="70071D89\n1\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go\tSpeak with TBD in TBD when you are ready to go.\n2\tSpeak with TBD in TBD\tSpeak with TBD in TBD.\n",
